# The map widget (cp0_map_widget.h, Deck Atlas 0.1 task 2) on a large portrait canvas, 480x800 (profile pda: the Pi 3A+
# 4.3" DSI upright, 8.5 px/mm, automatic scale 2x; the writing zone off, as in the other pda_* scenes): the page header,
# the map, an app's tab strip. Synthetic tiles only (harness_map.cpp). The position, markers and a track at the
# automatic 2x and at 1x and 1.5x, a selected marker, 512 px tiles at 1x. Golden at 480x800.
title pda map
sizes 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_PDA 0
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
mapdemo open
mapdemo scale auto
mapdemo fix 150 -80 150 2 45
mapdemo markers
mapdemo track
mapdemo wait
shot pda_map_auto
mapdemo scale 1x
mapdemo wait
shot pda_map_1x
mapdemo scale 1.5x
mapdemo markers 2
mapdemo wait
shot pda_map_15x_selected
mapdemo source hd
mapdemo scale 2x
mapdemo wait
shot pda_map_hd_1x
